+- Candidate source SHA-256: `a8fc7185749be72ea3fd546fa41f31cc85499e2da1ad5389aecaffac1d1e5a64`.
+- Source snapshot: 68 present files, plus the absent optional `apps/api/pnpm-lock.yaml` recorded as null.
